node_modules/
lib/
# 本机备份：装在 DSH profile 里的插件副本（本地测试前手动同步 lib/ 时留的）。
# 之前它只是**碰巧**被上面的 `lib/` 规则兜住 —— 因为备份目录里恰好只有 lib/ 一层。
# 多一层别的文件就会漏出来，所以这里显式声明。
.local-backup/
coverage/
# Everything under artifacts/ is a local build product (pnpm pack output, release notes).
# Nothing under it is tracked any more: the checksum list used to be exempted, but this fork
# lets CI compute it on the tag run (see RELEASE.md), and a committed copy only ever held the
# previous release's hashes — it read like "the hashes of this version" while being wrong.
artifacts/*
playwright-report/
test-results/
kotlin-sdk/.gradle/
kotlin-sdk/build/
*.tgz
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.tmp/

# Local DSH test harness (isolated DSH_HOME used for 0.2.x verification)
.testenv/
.commitmsg
.cm2
.tm2
.cm
.cm2
.mm
.c3
docs/project/.release-body-*.md
